{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneHabiroRootFamily","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.ComputeDegree"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.electron_block_pinned_level7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.electron_block_pinned_level7","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L88-L97","doc":"**The electron block is pinned by level-7 root agreement** — same instance for\n`d((3,1,1)) = t⁴−3t²+2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.muon_block_pinned_level7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.muon_block_pinned_level7","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L75-L86","doc":"**The muon block is pinned by level-7 root agreement.** A degree-`< 6` gauge-row\npolynomial agreeing with the muon value map `d((3,2)) = t⁴−3t²+1` at the six level-7\nfold points `2cos(kπ/7)` (`k = 1..6`) equals it identically — hence at the substrate\n`t₀`.  The concrete `n = 5`, `N = 7` instance of `eq_of_root_family_agreement`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.n5_degrees_lt_six","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.n5_degrees_lt_six","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L62-L71","doc":"Every `n = 5` value-map polynomial has degree `< 6` (`= 7 − 1`), the count of\nlevel-7 fold points. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly311","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly311","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L59-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly32","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly32","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L56-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.natDegree_poly41","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L53-L54","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly311","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly311","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L48-L49","doc":"Value-map polynomial of the electron block `(3,1,1)`: `d = [5]+1 = t⁴ − 3t² + 2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly32","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly32","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L45-L46","doc":"Value-map polynomial of the muon block `(3,2)`: `d = [5] = t⁴ − 3t² + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly41","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.poly41","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L42-L43","doc":"Value-map polynomial of `(4,1)`: `d = [4] = t³ − 2t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.vacPoly","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.vacPoly","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/KeystoneN5ValueMapRigidity.lean#L39-L40","doc":"Value-map polynomial of the vacuum block `(5)`: `d = [1] = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}